\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Structure of the mode-shape error (script \texttt  {shape\_error\_structure.py}; 14,000 training structures, covariances from the 1,400 healthy ones). Share: largest eigenvalue of the covariance of the shape residual orthogonal to the predicted shape (isotropic: 0.25). Ratio: residual variance along the direction in which the parameter changes the shape, divided by the variance $\sigma _{v,m}^2$ assumed by the likelihood (1: correct weight; $>1$: the likelihood over-weights that evidence). Last column: share of the mode-shape information about a bearing carried by each mode.}}{7}{table.caption.12}\protected@file@percent }
